# w2_l1 "Echo Caverns" from '@' to the exit on Expert (ticks:KEYS, keys L R U D F K), with the AXE a run carries
# from Canopy Village. A forward strike throws it low over the ground, a low strike skims it over the floor in front
# of the hero (it opens the spots there), a high strike throws it at head height, and each throw locks him for 6
# ticks. From the HAMMER on (the alcove of the Hatch Well) he swings the hammer, as every run does.
